  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TPG Rise Climate Global South Initiative, L.P.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An equity investment of up to (i) $75 million in TPG GSI, and (ii) $25 million in a TPG GSI co-investment sleeve. TPG GSI is a regional private equity fund targeting a total fund size of $1 billion. TPG GSI forms part of TPG&amp;apos;s broader strategy to deploy up to $2.5 billion in climate-focused investments across India, Southeast Asia, Africa, and Latin America. TPG GSI aims to provide primarily growth capital investments in companies operating in five key sub-sectors: (i) energy solutions, (ii) green mobility, (iii) sustainable fuels, (iv) sustainable materials and products, and (v) carbon solutions.</narrative>
  </description>
